    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Andrew Deftereos of Leonard Wilson Keenan Estate Agents is delighted to present this fabulous apartment to the property market. It is a well maintained upgraded one-bedroom, one bathroom apartment that comes to market in excellent condition throughout, offering bright, spacious accommodation and is in a well-established residential development.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property, you are welcomed by an entrance passage which leads to the bright open plan upgraded kitchen, dinner and lounge, this area is flooded with good light having a Southerly aspect. Leading off this area through glass doors is the good sized sunny balcony. The large bedroom with built in cupboards is also on this side, so is also bright and light. The fully upgraded stylish bathroom completes the apartment.  \r\n\r\nThe apartment comes with a dedicated underground parking and is a short walk to the dart station and bus terminal providing excellent transport options. It has excellent access to amenities for shopping and restaurants and walking distance to Father Collins Park offering excellent outdoor and recreational amenities. It has easy access to the M50 Motorway and N3 National Road, providing convenient routes to the city center and beyond and close to the Airport it is in a great location.\r\n\r\nThis apartment represents a fantastic opportunity to acquire a stylish and spacious lock up and go apartment in sought-after Dublin 13 location, ideal for first-time buyers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe features of this lovely apartment  include:\r\n\r\n•             Upgraded bathroom\r\n\r\n•             Upgraded Kitchen\r\n\r\n•             Upgraded floors\r\n\r\n•             Underground parking   \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended. \r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
